# Photo Order Configuration
#
# List filenames (one per line) in the order you want them to appear in the gallery.
# - Lines starting with # are comments and will be ignored
# - Empty lines are ignored
# - Only list the filename (e.g., "photo.jpg"), not the full path
# - Photos not listed here will appear after the ordered ones, sorted by date
#
# Example:
# favorite_family_photo.jpg
# graduation_2020.jpg
# vacation_beach.jpg
# wedding_day.jpg
#
# To use this file:
# 1. Copy this file to gallery/photo-order.txt
# 2. List your photos in desired order
# 3. Run: npm run build:manifest
# 4. Commit the updated data/images.json
